{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26980","headline":"谢秦校书与无可上人见访 · 姚合","name":"谢秦校书与无可上人见访","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"道同无宿约，三伏自从容。\n窗豁山侵座，扇摇风下松。\n客吟多遶竹，僧饭只凭钟。\n向晚分归路，莓苔行迹重。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26980.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26980","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}